  "rows": [
    {"physicalRow": 1, "ref": "p0181#2", "line": 1, "approximateY": 515, "kind": "cap", "text": "图 137", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 2, "ref": "p0181#3", "line": 1, "approximateY": 597, "kind": "p cont", "text": "正确的. 可简述如下： 入射线、反射线与在入射点作的两种", "font": "regular prefix, bold 入射线 through 两种"},
    {"physicalRow": 3, "ref": "p0181#3", "line": 2, "approximateY": 668, "kind": "p cont", "text": "媒质界面的垂线位于同一平面内，反射角 $\\gamma$ 等于入射角 $\\alpha$.", "font": "bold with bold-italic mathematical gamma/alpha"},
    {"physicalRow": 4, "ref": "p0181#4", "line": 1, "approximateY": 740, "kind": "p", "text": "显然，如果光的传播沿相反的方向进行（图 137б），也遵", "font": "regular; Cyrillic б identifies source subfigure"},
    {"physicalRow": 5, "ref": "p0181#4", "line": 2, "approximateY": 812, "kind": "p", "text": "守这个定律. 光路的可逆性，是光线的重要特性.", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 6, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 1, "approximateY": 884, "kind": "p open", "text": "可以用实验来证明光的反射定律", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 7, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 2, "approximateY": 956, "kind": "p open", "text": "的正确性. 为此，在圆盘中心（图 138）", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 8, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 3, "approximateY": 1028, "kind": "p open", "text": "固定一块平面镜或者一块平面玻璃，", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 9, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 4, "approximateY": 1100, "kind": "p open", "text": "使它们的反射面与圆盘的直径重合.", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 10, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 5, "approximateY": 1172, "kind": "p open", "text": "由可以沿圆周转动的专门的发光器发", "font": "regular; leading 由 retained without correction"},
    {"physicalRow": 11, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 6, "approximateY": 1244, "kind": "p open", "text": "出一窄束光入射到反射面上. 入射线", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 12, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 7, "approximateY": 1316, "kind": "p open", "text": "和反射线在圆盘的白色表面上留下光", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 13, "ref": "p0181#5", "line": 8, "approximateY": 1388, "kind": "p open", "text": "路. 把入射角从 $0^\\circ$ 增加到 $90^\\circ$ 时，可", "font": "regular; upright 0/90 with upper degree signs", "sharedObject": {"ref": "p0181#7", "line": 1, "kind": "cap samerow", "text": "图 138", "font": "regular"}},
    {"physicalRow": 14, "ref": "p0181#8", "line": 1, "approximateY": 1460, "kind": "p cont", "text": "以观察到反射角的变化. 在这种情况下，圆盘的竖直直径就", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 15, "ref": "p0181#8", "line": 2, "approximateY": 1535, "kind": "p cont", "text": "是在入射点垂直于镜平面的垂线. 观察证明了光的反射定律", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 16, "ref": "p0181#8", "line": 3, "approximateY": 1606, "kind": "p cont", "text": "和反射时光路的可逆性.", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 17, "ref": "p0181#9", "line": 1, "approximateY": 1679, "kind": "p open", "text": "平面镜成像 让发光点位于反射光的平面即平面镜的前", "font": "bold five-character inline heading; regular body"},
    {"physicalRow": 18, "ref": "p0181#9", "line": 2, "approximateY": 1752, "kind": "p open", "text": "面. 试问： 如果我们往镜子里看，能在哪儿看到这个点的像？", "font": "regular"},
    {"physicalRow": 19, "ref": "p0181#9", "line": 3, "approximateY": 1824, "kind": "p open", "text": "为了回答这个问题，我们来作从点 $S$ 发出的和反射后射入观", "font": "regular with italic mathematical S"},
    {"physicalRow": 20, "ref": "p0181#9", "line": 4, "approximateY": 1895, "kind": "p open", "text": "察者眼睛的几条光线（图 139）. 人们觉得光线似乎是从点 $S_1$", "font": "regular with italic S and upright subscript1; incomplete sentence"},
